      <description>&lt;p&gt;The release of ChatGPT on November 30, 2022 was a historical moment. In this post, GPT models are documented, along with several improvements over the transformer model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
